B.Nd=A.a(s(['Owner, before go-live: Admin \u2192 Import from Omunim now shows "Pieces Omunim no longer has". With the latest full export it lists the silver to delete for good and the gold to mark Made to Order, and changes nothing until you tap the button. Pieces added in the app are never touched.','Gold scheme (owner): on a card that started before the app, "Add months paid before the app (with dates)" adds the months already paid, each with the date it was paid. They get OB receipts and stay out of today\'s cash book. A card made the normal way becomes an earlier card first, while nothing is received on it in the app.','Owner, before go-live: More \u2192 Testing \u2192 "Delete everything: customers, karigars, vendors" clears all customers, karigars, vendors and others with every record and photo, for a fresh start. Stock, rates, staff and settings stay.',"Rates and purities: saving on one phone or the shop PC no longer removes purities, rates or making charges added on another device. Saving rates now needs the internet (it says so if it could not save).","Admin \u2192 Metal & purity rates lists any purity that designs use but is missing from the list: tap Put back, check the % and rate, and Save.",'Card payment on the bill: tap Card, pick the card type and the app shows what to swipe and the card charge to tell the customer (Paytm charges + 18% GST). Switch off "Customer pays the card charge" if the shop bears it.',"Today (day book): opening and closing money for the drawer and the bank, side by side, with a total. Card money counts what reaches the bank.","Record cash put in the bank or taken out of it (Today \u2192 Cash put in / taken out of bank). Set the opening bank balance once; each closed day carries it forward.","The separate Card swipe screen is gone; card charges are now in More \u2192 Bill rules (owner)."]),t.s)
